  "description": "# Wings++ para PowerNukkitX\n\nPorte do addon **Wings++** para plugin Java.\n\n- `src/main/java` : itens customizados, voo, livro guia e receitas (toda a logica do `scripts/*.js`).\n- `src/main/resources/WingsPlusRP.zip` : resource pack (modelos, texturas, animacoes) do addon original.\n  O plugin copia esse zip para `resource_packs/` ao iniciar; reinicie o servidor.\n- `config.yml` : velocidade do voo.\n\nBuild: `mvn package` -> `target/wings-plus-pnx-1.0.0.jar` em `plugins/`.\n\n<img width=\"919\" height=\"520\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/efda3541-b7ce-47ce-9e02-7197efce41b9\" />\n<img width=\"919\" height=\"499\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88554648-6c2f-475f-aa48-54565b087254\" />\n<img width=\"918\" height=\"513\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7f71952-dd90-474a-b10d-0c427e4bd6ae\" />\n<img width=\"913\" height=\"514\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9efbde8-fc9b-439f-ba17-68a3cc125848\" />\n\n\n",
